  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adequate protection for all workers including migrant workers in the SADC region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of commitment to implement the SADC Labour Migration Action Plan 2020-
2025 and other global, continental and regional migration frameworks, policies,
guidelines and action plans, Member States that are yet to do so urged to develop,
adopt and implement national labour migration policies; ILO in collaboration with the IOM provided technical support towards the effective implementation of the SADC Labour Migration Action Plan (2020-2025)</narrative>
  </description>
